entries.content:
Princess Hilda: [ The governing force of Lorule, and its Princess. She is Lorule's counterpart to Hyrule's Princess Zelda. Ravio respectfully calls her 'Princess Hilda' and would throw his life away for her. He is completely loyal, even though they don't always see eye to eye.

She is a truly selfless and devoted leader that would die by her people. During Lorule's food crisis, she did not choose to enjoy more than her people could have. All resources were given to Loruleans as seen possible. Being raised in a hopeless world, Hilda is strict and sometimes icily cold... But Ravio sees her benevolence and pure heart, even when her methods become misguided. 
]
